&lt;h2 id=&#34;-questions--ideas&#34;&gt;💚 Questions &amp;amp; Ideas
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions, suggestions or comments, please use our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/NAb6H3UTjK&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord channel&lt;/a&gt;. We&amp;rsquo;ve also launched our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/bluewave-labs/bluewave-uptime/discussions&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discussions&lt;/a&gt; page! Feel free to ask questions or share your ideas—we&amp;rsquo;d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-features&#34;&gt;🧩 Features
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Completely open source, deployable on your servers or home devices (e.g Raspberry Pi 4 or 5)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Website monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Page speed monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure monitoring (memory, disk usage, CPU performance etc) - requires &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/bluewave-labs/capture&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Capture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ping monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SSL monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Port monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incidents at a glance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Status pages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E-mail, Webhooks, Discord, Telegram, Slack notifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scheduled maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JSON query monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for multiple languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Short term roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/bluewave-labs/Checkmate/milestone/8&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Milestone 2.2&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Better notifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;..and a few more features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
