&lt;h2 id=&#34;-contributing&#34;&gt;🤝 Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;http://github.com/ajhollid&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Alex&lt;/a&gt; (team lead), &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;http://github.com/vishnusn77&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Vishnu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;http://github.com/mohicody&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Mohadeseh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;http://github.com/gorkem-bwl/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
