&lt;h2 id=&#34;-our-sponsors&#34;&gt;💰 Our sponsors
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thanks to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://gitbook.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
